Package: go2rtc
Version: 1.9.15
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Camera streaming hub - RTSP/WebRTC/HLS with web UI (go2rtc)
 go2rtc bridges your IP cameras and media sources into every consumer:
 standard RTSP out for players and NVRs, low-latency WebRTC and MSE for
 browsers, HLS for everything else — zero dependencies, single binary with
 an embedded web UI. Open http://<NAS>:18238 from the TOS desktop, add a
 stream (rtsp://...), and watch it live in the browser.
 Upstream project: https://github.com/AlexxIT/go2rtc (MIT), packaged
 unmodified.
